# EXPECT-VIOLATION: mirash:RemedySafetyShape
#
# A remedy declares no safety prerequisite. NOTE the severity: this shape is sh:Warning, an advisory
# for review, not a hard stop. The harness treats it as non-conforming (pyshacl reports
# conforms=False for a Warning-only result), which is what this fixture pins. Real hazard
# escalation is SAFETY_KEYWORDS in guardrails.py, a code path, not this shape.

